[1.05,"o","\r\n"]
[1.09,"o","Advisory (never on the live path):\r\n"]
[1.13,"o","  memory       \u2192 Mem0, Zep, Letta, Cognee, Supermemory, LangMem, MemPalace\r\n"]
[1.17,"o","  batch        \u2192 Anthropic / OpenAI Batch API (~50% off, no streaming)\r\n"]
[1.21,"o","\r\n"]
[1.25,"o","OpenBundle does not replace these tools \u2014 it selects, configures, and\r\n"]
[1.29,"o","runs them together for you. Full credits: CREDITS.md\r\n"]
[1.33,"o","\r\n"]
[1.37,"o","Observability SDKs default to vendor hosted free tiers. Traces leave this machine. Pass --local-obs to keep them here.\r\n"]
[1.41,"o","\r\n"]
[1.45,"o","Input scanners fail-open so a broken extra never blocks you. If one errors, `openbundle status` prints a DEGRADED banner, not a quiet live.\r\n"]
[1.49,"o","NeMo rails reuse your provider: extra tokens and latency when they fire (nemo_rail_tokens on status). GPTCache and Semantic Router do not share an embedding download unless a joint load test exists.\r\n"]
[1.53,"o","\r\n"]
[1.57,"o","No ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or OPENAI_API_KEY in the environment.\r\n"]
[1.61,"o","Attach your client:\r\n"]
[1.65,"o","  export ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4180\r\n"]
[1.69,"o","  # or OpenAI: base_url=http://127.0.0.1:4180/v1\r\n"]
[1.73,"o","\r\n"]
[1.77,"o","Then:  openbundle serve\r\n"]
[1.81,"o","Live number: openbundle status\r\n"]
[1.85,"o","Toggle: openbundle on | openbundle off\r\n"]
[1.89,"o","\r\n"]
[1.93,"o","$ openbundle serve --no-banner\r\n"]
[1.97,"o","OpenBundle v0.1.0 listening on http://127.0.0.1:4180\r\n"]
[2.01,"o","overlay: on\r\n"]
[2.05,"o","\r\n"]
